<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: SOCCER-ICELAND BEAT IRELAND 1-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ICELAND BEAT IRELAND 1-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iceland beat Ireland 1-0 (halftime</p>
<p>0-0) in a European under-21 soccer championship group eight</p>
<p>qualifier on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Bjarni Gudjonsson 61</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,000</p>
<p>Group standings (tabulate under - played, won, drawn, lost,</p>
<p>goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Iceland   4  3  0  1  8  3  9</p>
<p> Romania   2  2  0  0  5  3  6</p>
<p> Ireland   2  1  0  1  4  1  3</p>
<p> Lithuania 2  0  0  2  1  5  0</p>
<p> Macedonia 2  0  0  2  0  6  0</p>
</text>
